        "id": 16168
      },
      "writtenOn": "2016-01-08T13:32:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So, what you\u0027re saying, is to add custom Exception (i.e. DataReadException) and throw it without logging ?",
      "parentUuid": "fa69d971_f7e3c303",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 70,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 70,
        "endChar": 11
