      },
      "writtenOn": "2016-01-08T13:32:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hmm...I haven\u0027t checked if monasca-common has appropriate dependency to match Falcon exception for instance. If not, do you think it\u0027d be good to add it at this, somehow, lower level. After all that is library that supports monasca-api and the rest of monasca-* stuff, introducing library with exceptions you\u0027ve mentioned seems to much, doesn\u0027t it ?",
      "parentUuid": "fa69d971_57bbaf75",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 78,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 78,
        "endChar": 13
      },
